  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "1. Overview",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 15.0,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Titan Printer is a native Android driver application that connects a Bluetooth ESC/POS thermal receipt",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "printer to Android's built-in print system, so existing point-of-sale, ticketing, and business apps can print",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "receipts and labels to a thermal printer without any custom printer integration of their own.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Once installed, Titan Printer registers itself as a standard Android printer. From that point on, the",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "thermal printer shows up as a regular printer choice in the native Android \"Print\" dialog from any app on",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "the device. Titan Printer receives the document behind the scenes, renders it, and streams it to the",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "paired thermal printer over Bluetooth.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "2. Business Context",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 15.0,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Retail, hospitality, and field-service businesses running handheld or countertop Android devices",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "typically need to:",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nPrint receipts, tickets, or labels from apps that were never built with thermal-printer support",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nConnect to compact Bluetooth thermal printers without adding a vendor-specific SDK to every app",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nKeep printing reliable over Bluetooth, including automatic reconnection when a connection drops",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nSupport multiple copies of the same receipt or ticket from a single print request",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nKeep a simple record of what has recently been printed",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Building native thermal-printer support into every business app individually is costly and printer-specific.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Titan Printer solves this once, as a shared system-level driver: any app that can already print through",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Android prints straight to the thermal printer, with no per-app integration work.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "3. Key Capabilities",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 15.0,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Capability\nDescription",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Android Print Service\nIntegration",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Registers as a native Android printer so any app's standard Print action can\ntarget the thermal printer",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Bluetooth Auto-Discovery &\nPairing",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Automatically finds and pairs with the configured thermal printer over\nBluetooth",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Document-to-Thermal\nRendering",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Converts an incoming print document into a continuous image strip suited to\nreceipt-roll printers",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Multi-Page & Multi-Copy\nPrinting",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Concatenates multi-page documents and supports printing multiple copies\nfrom one job",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Automatic Reconnect &\nRetry",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Detects a dropped Bluetooth connection and retries automatically within a\nshort window",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
