  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Capability\nDescription",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Connection Status Indicator\nShows a clear connected/error status on the home screen",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Print Activity History\nA running view of recent print jobs, including timestamp and copy count",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Manual Test Print\nA one-tap test print to confirm the printer connection independent of any\nexternal app",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "3. Key Capabilities"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "4. Functional Modules",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 15.0,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "4.1 Android Print Service Registration",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": 3,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.1 Android Print Service Registration"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nTitan Printer registers a system print service that appears as a selectable printer in the Android print\npicker",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.1 Android Print Service Registration"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nAny app that supports standard Android printing can send a job to it without knowing a thermal printer\nis involved",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.1 Android Print Service Registration"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nEach print job is picked up by the service and handed off to the Bluetooth printing pipeline",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.1 Android Print Service Registration"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "4.2 Bluetooth Discovery & Pairing",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": 3,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.2 Bluetooth Discovery & Pairing"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nOn first run, the app scans for and automatically pairs with the configured thermal printer over\nBluetooth",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.2 Bluetooth Discovery & Pairing"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nA previously paired connection is reused on later print jobs",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.2 Bluetooth Discovery & Pairing"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nThe app can unpair and re-pair the printer to recover from a stuck connection, with manual pairing\nthrough the device's Bluetooth settings available as a fallback",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.2 Bluetooth Discovery & Pairing"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "4.3 Document Rendering for Thermal Output",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": 3,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.3 Document Rendering for Thermal Output"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nIncoming print documents are rendered page by page into an image",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.3 Document Rendering for Thermal Output"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nMultiple pages are stitched into a single continuous image, matching how thermal receipt printers print\ncontinuous rolls rather than discrete pages",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.3 Document Rendering for Thermal Output"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nBlank or empty edges are trimmed before printing to avoid wasting paper",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.3 Document Rendering for Thermal Output"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "4.4 Bluetooth Transmission to the Printer",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": 3,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.4 Bluetooth Transmission to the Printer"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nThe rendered image is converted into thermal-printer commands and streamed to the printer over its\nBluetooth connection",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.4 Bluetooth Transmission to the Printer"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nThe requested number of copies is printed in sequence from a single job",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.4 Bluetooth Transmission to the Printer"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nA paper feed is issued after each copy for a clean tear-off",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.4 Bluetooth Transmission to the Printer"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "4.5 Connection Resilience",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": 3,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.5 Connection Resilience"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nIf the Bluetooth connection fails mid-print, the app automatically retries for a short window before\nreporting a failure",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "4. Functional Modules",
      "4.5 Connection Resilience"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
