    "text": "Any App Sends a \"Print\" Request\n|\nv\nAndroid Print Dialog: Select Thermal Printer\n|\nv\nTitan Printer Service Receives Document\n|\nv\nCheck Bluetooth Connection to Thermal Printer\n|\n+--------+--------+\n| |\nv v\nConnected Not Connected\n| |\n| v\n| Auto-Discover & Pair with Printer\n| |\n+--------+--------+\n|\nv\nRender Document Pages into a Continuous Image\n|\nv\nConvert Image to Thermal Printer Commands\n|\nv\nStream to Printer over Bluetooth (per copy requested)\n|\nv\nFeed Paper & Complete Job\n|\nv\nJob Recorded in Print History",
